CHANGED: Normalization transformations declare the `Term` constructors they can fire on (`Clash.Rewrite.Shape`), and the strategies dispatch on a node's constructor with a single match, skipping transformations that cannot apply. Measured ~8% faster normalization on a large industrial design, without changing the produced HDL. Only debug output changes: `-fclash-debug-transformations` no longer prints "Trying:" lines for transformations that structurally cannot match a node.
